%% Multi-LLM Collaboration Flow Diagram (Mermaid)
%% Shows how multiple LLMs collaborate on complex tasks

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Router as Task Router
    participant Gemini as ✨ Gemini
    participant ChatGPT as 💬 ChatGPT
    participant Claude as 🤖 Claude Code
    participant Tools as Tool Manager
    participant K8s as Kubernetes

    Note over User,K8s: Example: "Build a complete monitoring dashboard"

    User->>Orch: "Build complete dashboard with deployment"

    Orch->>Router: route(message, enable_collaboration=True)

    Router->>Router: Detect collaboration pattern
    Router->>Router: Create collaboration plan

    Router-->>Orch: RoutingDecision<br/>collaboration_plan=[Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude]

    Note over Orch: Multi-LLM Collaboration Required

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Gemini: Step 1: Optimize Requirements
        Orch->>Gemini: complete("Build dashboard...")
        Gemini->>Gemini: Analyze requirements
        Gemini->>Gemini: Create optimal specifications
        Gemini->>Gemini: Design best practices
        Gemini-->>Orch: "Detailed specs:<br/>- Real-time metrics<br/>- Alert system<br/>- Auto-refresh"
        Note over Orch: Context accumulated
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over ChatGPT: Step 2: Design UI/UX
        Orch->>ChatGPT: complete("Previous: [Gemini specs]<br/>Now design UI...")
        ChatGPT->>ChatGPT: Design layout
        ChatGPT->>ChatGPT: Create components
        ChatGPT->>ChatGPT: Define interactions
        ChatGPT-->>Orch: "Dashboard design:<br/>- Grid layout<br/>- Chart components<br/>- Navigation"
        Note over Orch: Context accumulated
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Claude: Step 3: Implement & Deploy
        Orch->>Claude: complete("Previous: [Gemini + ChatGPT]<br/>Now implement...")
        Claude->>Claude: Generate code
        Claude->>Claude: Create Docker config
        Claude->>Claude: Request tool execution
        Claude-->>Orch: "Code + tool_calls:<br/>- build_docker_image()<br/>- deploy_to_k8s()"

        Orch->>Tools: execute_tools(tool_calls)
        Tools->>Tools: Build Docker image
        Tools->>K8s: Deploy to cluster
        K8s-->>Tools: deployment_url
        Tools-->>Orch: tool_results

        Orch->>Claude: complete(messages + tool_results)
        Claude-->>Orch: "✅ Deployed to:<br/>https://dashboard.example.com"
    end

    Orch->>Orch: Aggregate all steps

    Orch-->>User: ChatResponse<br/>collaboration_steps=[3]<br/>message=[Full implementation]

    Note over User: Receives:<br/>1. Optimized specs (Gemini)<br/>2. UI design (ChatGPT)<br/>3. Deployed dashboard (Claude)
